From 47f704c4f3321ee826b923e45a89825b5647bf61 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Christopher Crouse <mail@amz-x.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 10:03:28 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Convert high bit depth icons to 8 bit

A single 16 bit PNG icon in the grid switches GTK's GPU renderer to
high depth intermediates for the whole frame, in which SVG icons using
feFlood + feBlend (e.g. Proton Mail Bridge) render as black squares.
---
 src/Widgets/AppButton.vala  |   6 +-
 src/Widgets/AppIcon.vala    | 120 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 src/Widgets/AppListRow.vala |   5 +-
 src/Widgets/SearchItem.vala |   9 ++-
 src/meson.build             |   1 +
 5 files changed, 130 insertions(+), 11 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 src/Widgets/AppIcon.vala

